        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump Limmatschulhaus</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump Limmatschulhaus
This data set describes  . Data regarding to assembly stems from company data, requirements of working materials from literature. Transport distances are estimated.;
UUID: 7bd453ee-28f2-32c2-9878-20a82ed297da
This data set includes the assembling of the heat pump as well as the refrigerant emissions when filling the equipment and transports of components.
Location: This data represent the assembling in Switzerland.
Technology: Data set for a brine-water heat pump.
Time period: Data for refrigerant use, quantity of compressors and total material is actual data from questionnaire, rest of data is estimated from literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: Extrapolated from a 50 kW heat pump
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7bd453ee-28f2-32c2-9878-20a82ed297da.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
